OL,3,GNEWSACollege lecturer admits killing
OL,4,Ahusband and wife in drink-drive crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former college lecturer has admitted
OL,7,Fkilling a husband and wife in a head-on
OL,8,Fcrash while drink-driving after a work
OL,9,FChristmas party.
OL,11,FSophie Hynd caused the deaths of
OL,12,FJatinder Kaur, 48, and her husband
OL,13,FSatwant Singh, 64, on the B981 in
OL,14,FCluny, Fife, on December 19 last year.
OL,16,FHynd, 33, who lost her job teaching
OL,17,Fcomputer animation at Fife College,
OL,18,Fwept as she was remanded in custody at
OL,19,Fthe High Court in Edinburgh.
OL,21,FJudge Michael O'Grady KC described the
OL,22,Foffence as "very grave".
